    "text": "Job Prospects: Graduates gain the necessary skills to find positions in the data science field requiring a mix of data analysis skills, the ability to deal with large quantities of data, and a strong foundation in computer science. Graduates are also prepared to undertake doctoral studies, either to deepen their overall data science expertise or learn how to better use their analytics skills in a particular data-rich domain.",
